WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.632 --> 01:43.969
=Episode 4=
(Xu Zhi, Turn Around and Look at Me)

01:47.212 --> 01:49.413
You should learn from Chen Luzhou.

01:49.572 --> 01:51.293
Look at his level of thought,

01:52.132 --> 01:55.013
capturing the beauty of the world
with the camera.

01:55.893 --> 01:58.212
Even the pheasants in his pictures
appear in pairs.

01:59.333 --> 02:00.373
Now look at you.

02:00.773 --> 02:02.333
You should talk more about things

02:02.572 --> 02:05.293
like the stars and the sea,
ideals, and such.

02:05.732 --> 02:06.893
No money talk anymore.

02:07.192 --> 02:07.893
It's vulgar.

02:07.893 --> 02:09.813
I think you just don't want
to give him a raise.

02:10.252 --> 02:11.532
He didn't tell me.

02:11.692 --> 02:12.453
Why do you argue?

02:13.293 --> 02:14.532
Why can't I argue?

02:14.692 --> 02:16.773
He's my responsibility.
I introduced him to you.

02:17.413 --> 02:18.293
I think

02:19.373 --> 02:22.013
you should get it down to written form

02:22.532 --> 02:23.373
to avoid any default.

02:24.813 --> 02:26.453
(Isn't she not interested in me?)

02:27.172 --> 02:28.532
(Why is she defending me?)

02:29.973 --> 02:31.172
Applied for college yet?

02:31.773 --> 02:32.692
Which college?

02:33.893 --> 02:34.853
Qingyi University.

02:35.293 --> 02:36.013
Qingyi University?

02:36.853 --> 02:37.893
Are you joking?

02:38.493 --> 02:39.813
In the last mock exam,

02:40.052 --> 02:41.368
you ranked in the city's top 10.

02:41.532 --> 02:43.293
Aren't you going to Beijing or Shanghai?

02:45.493 --> 02:46.692
Qingyi University is good.

02:47.333 --> 02:48.493
When I'm free,

02:48.612 --> 02:49.692
I can walk your dog.

02:49.692 --> 02:50.933
Here, walk the dog. Take this.

02:52.013 --> 02:54.172
Are you worried
about your dad and your grandma?

02:55.172 --> 02:57.333
Your dad's illness has long been cured.
Don't worry.

02:57.572 --> 02:59.333
Your grandma has me and Mr. Cai.

02:59.333 --> 03:01.413
I can handle my own matters properly.

03:02.013 --> 03:02.520
Let's go.

03:04.773 --> 03:05.572
I'm so worried.

03:55.493 --> 03:56.293
Hello, Mom.

03:58.092 --> 03:59.333
Have you been busy lately?

03:59.652 --> 04:01.252
I'll be busy until mid-next month.

04:01.692 --> 04:03.732
Why? Did Chen Xingqi
cause trouble again?

04:03.813 --> 04:05.532
No, I'm just checking.

04:08.853 --> 04:09.692
I have a friend.

04:09.933 --> 04:11.576
If you have time...

04:11.576 --> 04:12.076
Hui.

04:12.076 --> 04:12.576
Could you...

04:12.576 --> 04:13.080
Hui.

04:13.853 --> 04:15.252
I have to go. Watch your brother.

04:15.612 --> 04:16.212
I'm hanging up.

04:45.773 --> 04:47.052
Why didn't I answer your phone?

04:47.333 --> 04:48.813
Don't you know it yourself?

04:50.893 --> 04:51.652
Hang up, will you?

04:52.212 --> 04:53.333
Isn't Chai Jingjing

04:53.333 --> 04:54.853
waiting for you to have coffee?

04:55.493 --> 04:57.572
Are there girls
who are usually close to Zhai Xiao?

04:58.373 --> 04:59.252
After graduation,

04:59.252 --> 05:00.453
he seems to have a girlfriend.

05:00.732 --> 05:02.532
Her name sounds a lot like mine, right?

05:03.933 --> 05:04.472
Got it.

05:04.813 --> 05:06.293
It's Chai Jingjing,

05:06.612 --> 05:07.773
from the 8th High School.

05:09.413 --> 05:10.413
Chai Jingjing.

05:17.453 --> 05:18.453
Zhai Xiao?

05:20.652 --> 05:21.453
Hurry.

05:23.132 --> 05:24.373
I don't have to make excuses

05:24.652 --> 05:25.656
since you found it out.

05:26.212 --> 05:26.712
That's it.

05:28.052 --> 05:28.893
Zhai Xiao,

05:29.172 --> 05:30.333
do you have any shame?

05:30.413 --> 05:31.732
You're still so arrogant.

05:32.373 --> 05:33.933
Really think you're a princess, huh?

05:34.652 --> 05:36.092
If it weren't for your dean dad

05:36.092 --> 05:36.773
backing you up,

05:36.893 --> 05:38.773
what are you, Cai Yingying?

05:39.933 --> 05:40.493
I...

05:40.493 --> 05:41.692
You get by day by day

05:42.453 --> 05:43.373
with no goals or plans.

05:43.373 --> 05:44.898
You even dare not estimate your score.

05:45.092 --> 05:45.732
Someone like you

05:45.732 --> 05:47.052
acting all arrogant with me?

05:47.172 --> 05:47.973
Shut up.

05:48.453 --> 05:49.293
I don't need you

05:49.293 --> 05:50.532
to judge my life.

05:50.692 --> 05:51.773
Now get lost.

06:04.252 --> 06:05.293
Miss Model,

06:05.532 --> 06:06.172
are you okay?

06:06.973 --> 06:08.052
I'm fine.

06:15.013 --> 06:16.732
We're in the middle of nowhere.

06:16.732 --> 06:18.132
We can't play Whac-A-Mole.

06:20.853 --> 06:22.132
How about

06:22.252 --> 06:23.612
we drag Chen Xingqi over here

06:23.692 --> 06:24.493
and beat him up?

06:24.813 --> 06:25.532
Whac-A-Mole?

06:25.933 --> 06:26.532
You forgot?

06:26.973 --> 06:27.853
Scoundrel.

06:28.172 --> 06:28.773
Take this.

06:28.773 --> 06:29.493
Take this.

06:30.092 --> 06:31.172
I'll beat you to death.

06:31.572 --> 06:32.212
Take this.

06:34.893 --> 06:36.052
Why are you standing here?

06:36.052 --> 06:36.612
Me?

06:36.612 --> 06:37.293
Join me now.

06:38.013 --> 06:38.584
Okay.

06:38.933 --> 06:39.572
Right away.

06:39.813 --> 06:42.333
Scoundrel, I'll beat you to death.

06:42.333 --> 06:43.052
Alright.

06:45.853 --> 06:47.052
So you heard everything?

06:47.052 --> 06:47.576
I...

06:47.893 --> 06:48.893
I didn't mean to.

06:48.893 --> 06:49.413
I swear.

06:49.773 --> 06:51.172
Then why didn't you defend me?

06:53.333 --> 06:54.092
Alright.

06:54.732 --> 06:56.652
Next time, I'll show you what I got.

06:57.132 --> 06:57.813
No need.

06:58.013 --> 07:00.092
Don't waste your breath
on an unworthy scoundrel.

07:01.893 --> 07:02.393
Yingying,

07:03.493 --> 07:04.652
your modeling job isn't over.

07:12.732 --> 07:14.413
Chen Luzhou, be responsible for me.

07:17.692 --> 07:18.692
Being busy, Lucy?

07:19.293 --> 07:19.800
Nothing.

07:20.893 --> 07:21.973
What's up with him?

07:23.013 --> 07:23.893
It's all your fault.

07:24.052 --> 07:25.773
You insisted on us
sketching in the woods.

07:26.132 --> 07:27.493
The mosquitoes were killing me.

07:28.373 --> 07:28.888
Let me see.

07:32.493 --> 07:33.272
No medicine?

07:34.652 --> 07:36.692
I brought mosquito repellent, bro.

07:36.692 --> 07:37.373
Who to blame?

07:37.532 --> 07:38.333
You didn't bring it.

07:38.973 --> 07:40.572
The mountain mosquitoes are vicious.

07:41.132 --> 07:42.172
I feel like I'm hit by...

07:42.712 --> 07:43.293
well...

07:43.732 --> 07:44.933
Nine Yin White Bone Claw.

07:45.532 --> 07:46.333
I'm itchy all over.

07:46.333 --> 07:47.532
Nine Yin White Bone Claw?

07:47.532 --> 07:49.333
Nine Yin White Bone Claw crushes skulls.

07:49.652 --> 07:51.293
Alright, go take a shower first.

07:51.453 --> 07:53.172
Later, I'll ask who brought medicine.

07:56.732 --> 07:59.333
Are you trying
to hit on the young ladies?

08:04.813 --> 08:05.773
Mind your own business.

08:06.052 --> 08:07.212
You're so boring.

08:08.252 --> 08:09.172
Totally love-struck.

08:10.172 --> 08:10.973
What a pity.

08:11.853 --> 08:13.092
She just doesn't like you.

08:17.492 --> 08:18.452
Zhu Yangqi.

08:19.332 --> 08:20.933
Can't you keep your mouth shut?

08:21.132 --> 08:22.613
Should I have someone zip it for you?

08:23.013 --> 08:24.573
I didn't say it.

08:24.973 --> 08:25.893
Chen Xingqi.

08:26.452 --> 08:28.092
It has nothing to do with Stylish Zhu.

08:28.533 --> 08:29.933
Last night at the bar,

08:30.172 --> 08:30.933
that microphone

08:31.573 --> 08:32.893
made a loud sound.

08:34.052 --> 08:36.452
The whole villa should have heard it.

08:38.292 --> 08:39.013
Seeking a beating?

08:39.372 --> 08:40.252
Remember my medicine.

08:51.492 --> 08:53.613
Ask for me on WeChat later to see

08:53.733 --> 08:54.973
if Xu Zhi brought the medicine.

08:58.492 --> 08:59.773
I've zipped my mouth.

09:00.452 --> 09:01.372
I can't speak.

09:03.252 --> 09:03.768
Okay.

09:05.212 --> 09:07.052
Don't let me know who you like later.

09:09.933 --> 09:11.613
(Do you have any anti-itch cream?)

09:12.013 --> 09:13.592
(Chen Xingqi got mosquito bites.)

09:16.973 --> 09:18.693
(I'll bring it to you in the lobby.)

09:20.492 --> 09:21.052
See?

09:21.372 --> 09:23.212
Isn't this a chance to meet?

09:23.492 --> 09:25.092
Then get it for me, alright?

09:25.693 --> 09:26.372
I won't.

09:27.052 --> 09:28.372
I just want you two to meet.

09:28.973 --> 09:30.013
I want to see how she

09:30.013 --> 09:31.332
barely pays you any attention.

09:31.893 --> 09:32.973
I find it amusing to watch.

09:33.252 --> 09:34.693
If you have the guts, go after her.

09:39.653 --> 09:40.933
If you dare, go pursue her.

09:41.893 --> 09:42.893
What for?

09:43.653 --> 09:44.573
Breaking up soon

09:44.853 --> 09:46.092
to get a love experience card?

09:46.813 --> 09:47.452
Alright.

09:47.893 --> 09:49.492
As long as you can hold back.

10:23.512 --> 10:25.214
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

10:26.104 --> 10:28.542
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

10:28.791 --> 10:30.678
♪Falling into your eyes♪

10:31.351 --> 10:33.655
♪Oh oh♪

10:34.015 --> 10:35.775
♪Billions of raindrops♪

10:36.446 --> 10:38.894
♪Like the universe's response♪

10:39.071 --> 10:41.242
♪Landing in my heart's depth♪

10:42.799 --> 10:45.911
♪Ah ah♪

10:46.562 --> 10:50.974
♪Ah ah♪

10:52.142 --> 10:56.000
♪We met across billions of light-years♪

10:56.551 --> 10:58.903
♪Ah ah♪

10:59.275 --> 11:04.533
♪Ah ah♪

11:04.533 --> 11:05.080
You're here.

11:06.653 --> 11:07.533
For a while.

11:08.853 --> 11:09.452
Sorry.

11:10.013 --> 11:11.853
These colorful little fish

11:12.013 --> 11:12.653
are quite cute.

11:15.256 --> 11:15.773
By the way,

11:17.092 --> 11:18.252
my dad's friend gave us this.

11:19.212 --> 11:20.973
It smells a bit like menthol.

11:21.613 --> 11:23.452
Let your brother make do with it.

11:24.292 --> 11:24.813
Thanks.

11:25.212 --> 11:25.853
You're welcome.

11:29.733 --> 11:30.492
Had dinner yet?

11:31.372 --> 11:31.973
No.

11:32.813 --> 11:33.452
Want to join me?

11:46.693 --> 11:47.224
Here.

11:47.412 --> 11:48.212
What do you want?

11:48.292 --> 11:49.452
You decide. I'm not picky.

11:49.853 --> 11:50.360
Okay.

12:01.452 --> 12:02.492
(I'm eating with her.)

12:02.733 --> 12:04.252
(Have dinner yourself.)

12:09.332 --> 12:10.412
(I underestimated)

12:10.412 --> 12:11.853
(the charm of you scoundrel.)

12:22.613 --> 12:23.452
Don't order alcohol.

12:24.172 --> 12:24.952
Let's drink soda.

12:24.952 --> 12:26.092
Don't be like Cai Yingying,

12:26.092 --> 12:26.773
drunk and blue.

12:29.013 --> 12:31.252
It's fine. I can hold my liquor.
I won't get drunk.

12:33.733 --> 12:34.813
Alright, suit yourself.

12:35.733 --> 12:36.252
Excuse me.

12:37.092 --> 12:37.933
A glass of lemonade.

12:38.092 --> 12:38.693
Okay.

12:42.013 --> 12:42.813
Dad.

12:46.412 --> 12:48.973
Dad, I want to drink orange soda.

12:49.813 --> 12:50.853
Let me open it for you.

12:53.492 --> 12:54.332
Xu.

12:56.292 --> 12:57.092
Perfect timing.

12:57.332 --> 12:59.052
Zhi said this is expired, right?

12:59.452 --> 13:00.013
This...

13:00.600 --> 13:01.172
Come on.

13:01.172 --> 13:02.172
Let me take a look.

13:03.292 --> 13:04.292
Can't you see

13:04.292 --> 13:05.172
such big letters?

13:06.132 --> 13:06.653
Presbyopia?

13:06.653 --> 13:07.452
Yes.

13:07.452 --> 13:09.013
Don't drink such unhealthy things.

13:09.372 --> 13:10.092
Come on, sweetie.

13:10.853 --> 13:11.933
Let's have some lemonade.

13:17.372 --> 13:18.733
I don't want lemonade.

13:18.733 --> 13:19.893
I want something sweet.

13:21.252 --> 13:21.813
Be good.

13:22.733 --> 13:25.292
Drink it. It whitens and is healthy.

13:29.613 --> 13:30.212
It whitens.

13:38.412 --> 13:40.372
Excuse me,
we'd like two glasses of lemonade

13:40.492 --> 13:41.733
and a set meal for two.

13:42.092 --> 13:42.616
Okay.

13:42.773 --> 13:43.332
Thank you.

13:57.452 --> 13:58.092
Why stare at me?

13:59.933 --> 14:01.893
You don't have
any bad habits usually, right?

14:02.172 --> 14:02.813
No, I don't.

14:04.492 --> 14:05.132
Almost none.

14:05.332 --> 14:06.132
Why this question?

14:08.052 --> 14:09.412
How long do you plan to live?

14:09.613 --> 14:10.252
So disciplined.

14:11.332 --> 14:12.052
Is this sarcasm?

14:12.813 --> 14:14.052
Am I being a buzzkiller to you?

14:15.052 --> 14:16.013
Let's have alcohol then.

14:16.212 --> 14:16.773
No need.

14:22.693 --> 14:23.693
Lemonade is quite good.

14:24.212 --> 14:25.252
My mom often drank it.

14:30.733 --> 14:31.492
Here is your food.

14:35.452 --> 14:36.172
Thank you.

14:44.613 --> 14:45.492
Please enjoy.

14:53.533 --> 14:55.013
Your estimated score is quite high,

14:55.853 --> 14:56.893
according to Cai Yingying.

14:57.813 --> 14:58.933
What college will you go to?

14:59.332 --> 15:00.573
I want to stay in this city

15:00.773 --> 15:02.613
and study architecture
at Qingyi University.

15:03.052 --> 15:03.773
Architecture?

15:04.412 --> 15:05.052
What?

15:05.573 --> 15:06.653
Can't girls study it?

15:07.492 --> 15:08.212
Not what I meant.

15:09.653 --> 15:11.693
Its School of Architecture is ordinary.

15:13.092 --> 15:14.092
Given your score,

15:14.492 --> 15:16.013
won't you go to Shanghai or Beijing?

15:16.773 --> 15:18.013
Alright, I misunderstood you.

15:18.613 --> 15:19.332
Actually,

15:19.813 --> 15:21.613
my friends and relatives

15:21.693 --> 15:23.292
always advise me to change my major,

15:23.973 --> 15:25.813
saying that few girls
study architecture.

15:26.252 --> 15:27.773
I thought you thought the same.

15:29.452 --> 15:30.613
I actually think girls

15:30.893 --> 15:32.693
can do better in architecture than boys.

15:34.973 --> 15:35.533
Really?

15:37.332 --> 15:39.132
Apart from space, structure, and logic,

15:39.973 --> 15:41.092
architectural works actually

15:41.452 --> 15:43.372
are somewhat like literary works.

15:43.573 --> 15:44.813
They need emotions.

15:46.292 --> 15:47.452
I think in this aspect,

15:47.452 --> 15:48.853
girls may be more subtle than boys.

15:50.973 --> 15:52.412
But it's just my personal opinion.

15:53.813 --> 15:56.452
There is an underwater bookstore
in the city.

15:56.452 --> 15:57.172
Do you know it?

15:57.813 --> 15:58.492
I heard it is

15:58.492 --> 15:59.653
a female architect's work.

16:00.853 --> 16:01.973
You know that too?

16:03.332 --> 16:04.893
The underwater design is very clever.

16:05.813 --> 16:07.653
When you read
by the glass window and look up,

16:07.933 --> 16:10.372
you can see water,
plants, fish, and insects.

16:10.653 --> 16:12.733
People, nature, and architecture

16:13.052 --> 16:14.332
harmoniously blend together.

16:14.733 --> 16:15.733
It's a great design.

16:18.853 --> 16:20.372
But you're different from other girls.

16:20.733 --> 16:22.613
The word 'subtle'
might not apply to you.

16:29.813 --> 16:30.452
But I think

16:31.013 --> 16:31.653
you can

16:32.212 --> 16:33.092
do whatever well.

16:37.492 --> 16:38.813
I'll take it as a compliment.

16:39.533 --> 16:40.412
I'm complimenting you.

17:00.492 --> 17:01.132
What about you?

17:01.452 --> 17:02.452
You study art, right?

17:02.773 --> 17:03.693
What are your plans?

17:05.013 --> 17:06.733
I feel like you have a lot of options.

17:07.613 --> 17:08.973
Who told you I study art?

17:09.172 --> 17:10.853
You and Zhu Yangqi are good friends.

17:11.492 --> 17:12.853
I thought you were art students.

17:14.052 --> 17:14.613
I'm not.

17:15.013 --> 17:16.052
I'm a regular student.

17:17.252 --> 17:18.773
You failed the college entrance exam?

17:22.092 --> 17:23.893
I heard your mom say that
at the door earlier.

17:26.052 --> 17:26.613
Sort of.

17:27.813 --> 17:28.573
Something happened.

17:30.412 --> 17:31.013
Alright.

17:33.693 --> 17:34.292
Not full yet?

17:35.212 --> 17:35.813
Time to go.

17:37.573 --> 17:39.052
You go first. I'll sit for a while.

17:39.412 --> 17:40.653
Don't forget the ointment.

17:40.973 --> 17:42.092
It's in my pocket.

17:42.733 --> 17:43.292
Okay.

17:45.773 --> 17:46.933
Want to sneak some alcohol?

17:53.052 --> 17:54.573
I know what you're majoring in.

17:55.733 --> 17:57.653
Police or criminal investigation.

17:59.492 --> 18:00.573
My dad has always said

18:00.933 --> 18:01.773
I can't be a cop.

18:02.092 --> 18:02.600
Why?

18:03.292 --> 18:04.172
I'm too handsome

18:04.492 --> 18:05.853
and too conspicuous in a crowd.

18:06.092 --> 18:07.212
Being an undercover cop

18:07.372 --> 18:08.212
makes me vulnerable.

18:13.212 --> 18:14.773
You really are quite narcissistic.

18:15.613 --> 18:16.332
Are you leaving?

18:16.332 --> 18:17.212
I can't drink.

18:17.693 --> 18:18.452
Allergy?

18:18.933 --> 18:19.613
Not really.

18:19.853 --> 18:20.893
I can't hold my liquor.

18:21.733 --> 18:23.172
When I was younger, Zhu Yangqi's dad

18:23.172 --> 18:24.252
made me drink liquor.

18:24.533 --> 18:26.132
I chatted with his grandma all night.

18:27.372 --> 18:29.092
I even aggravated her shoulder pain.

18:29.412 --> 18:30.693
She was bedridden for a week.

18:32.573 --> 18:33.172
Impressive.

18:36.533 --> 18:37.492
Oh my gosh.

18:38.292 --> 18:40.813
What kind of person is Chen Luzhou?

18:41.813 --> 18:43.492
Next time, we have to get him drunk

18:43.893 --> 18:45.653
and see what he can talk about
for all night.

18:46.092 --> 18:46.773
Good idea.

18:53.292 --> 18:55.292
I'm tired. I'm taking a shower.

19:27.452 --> 19:28.533
(I actually think girls)

19:28.893 --> 19:30.533
(can do better in architecture
than boys.)

19:45.973 --> 19:48.418
(The National Astronomical Observatory's
latest forecast says)

19:48.733 --> 19:50.573
(the highly anticipated
Aries meteor shower)

19:50.573 --> 19:52.172
(will reach its peak)

19:52.172 --> 19:53.372
(between 11 PM tonight)

19:53.372 --> 19:54.733
(and 1 AM tomorrow.)

19:55.332 --> 19:56.973
(Tonight is its peak viewing period.
It's also the Northern Hemisphere's...)

19:57.132 --> 19:58.052
Zhi. Zhi.

19:58.573 --> 20:00.013
Look, a meteor shower.

20:01.013 --> 20:02.733
The ten things to do after graduation

20:02.733 --> 20:03.853
must have a meteor shower.

20:04.853 --> 20:05.893
Let's go see it.

20:06.773 --> 20:08.332
Let's invite Chen Luzhou and others.

20:09.212 --> 20:09.720
Okay.

20:11.412 --> 20:13.332
(It is recommended
to use moisture-proof mats...)

20:14.492 --> 20:15.172
Hello, Dad.

20:15.384 --> 20:15.928
Hello,

20:16.172 --> 20:16.853
Zhi.

20:18.132 --> 20:19.292
How is it going at the villa?

20:20.252 --> 20:21.092
I'm having fun.

20:21.573 --> 20:22.412
You know what?

20:22.492 --> 20:23.973
It's really cool in the mountains.

20:24.613 --> 20:26.492
Mr. Fu said once the tea is roasted,

20:26.492 --> 20:27.693
I must get two bags for you.

20:28.052 --> 20:28.773
Okay.

20:30.492 --> 20:31.132
Wait a moment.

20:35.933 --> 20:36.492
Xu Zhi,

20:36.773 --> 20:37.853
is Yingying next to you?

20:38.172 --> 20:39.332
Put her on the phone.

20:41.492 --> 20:42.052
It's for you.

20:42.372 --> 20:43.013
Me?

20:44.573 --> 20:45.252
Hello?

20:45.653 --> 20:46.292
Cai Yingying.

20:46.973 --> 20:47.613
What?

20:48.172 --> 20:49.013
Tell me.

20:49.773 --> 20:50.573
Why didn't you

20:50.573 --> 20:51.492
put away the hair dye?

20:52.052 --> 20:53.372
Your grandma now has green hair.

20:53.372 --> 20:54.613
Isn't that embarrassing?

20:56.933 --> 20:59.212
Grandma herself used the wrong hair dye.

20:59.332 --> 21:00.013
Not my fault.

21:00.172 --> 21:00.813
Besides,

21:01.212 --> 21:03.132
who says an old lady
can't dye her hair green?

21:04.292 --> 21:05.212
Cut the nonsense.

21:05.813 --> 21:07.092
Listen to me. Right now, you...

21:07.092 --> 21:07.893
Cai Binhong,

21:08.332 --> 21:09.773
stop talking like this. I'll be mad.

21:09.773 --> 21:10.533
I'll not go back.

21:10.693 --> 21:11.573
Suit yourself.

21:13.052 --> 21:13.653
You're fierce.

21:13.973 --> 21:14.653
Ignore him.

21:15.052 --> 21:16.292
Let's see the meteor shower.

21:18.533 --> 21:19.332
She hung up.

21:19.733 --> 21:21.533
Why was she getting mad at me?

21:24.933 --> 21:26.372
As a new high school graduate,

21:26.613 --> 21:28.132
why are you so awesome, Lucy?

21:28.853 --> 21:30.452
I've been awesome for 18 years already.

21:31.533 --> 21:32.893
Don't push it.

21:45.613 --> 21:47.252
Cai Yingying said an Aries meteor shower

21:47.252 --> 21:48.292
will be here at 11 PM,

21:48.653 --> 21:49.693
wondering if you'll go.

21:49.693 --> 21:51.092
No. I have to edit the video.

21:55.013 --> 21:57.013
She said Xu Zhi seems to be going too.

21:59.933 --> 22:00.452
She said

22:00.893 --> 22:02.733
Xu Zhi's mother was also an Aries,

22:03.292 --> 22:04.533
and a departed family member

22:04.533 --> 22:06.052
would turn into a meteor in the sky.

22:06.492 --> 22:07.013
So

22:08.013 --> 22:08.733
she wants to go.

22:09.813 --> 22:10.813
She believes in that?

22:11.172 --> 22:11.773
Yeah.

22:19.052 --> 22:21.212
Lucy, you are so fickle.

22:22.212 --> 22:22.933
Are you going?

22:24.653 --> 22:25.240
Yes.

22:37.132 --> 22:38.573
Those are quite bright colors.

22:38.573 --> 22:40.533
Why don't you usually wear them?

22:40.533 --> 22:41.292
Why today?

22:41.613 --> 22:42.498
None of your business.

22:44.573 --> 22:45.613
By the way,

22:46.893 --> 22:48.452
you came back so late last night.

22:48.693 --> 22:50.693
Was there any progress with Xu Zhi?

22:51.092 --> 22:51.693
What progress?

22:52.573 --> 22:54.132
We just chatted and had dinner.

22:54.132 --> 22:55.013
Then we parted ways.

22:55.533 --> 22:56.372
You chatted?

22:57.212 --> 22:58.013
About what?

22:59.132 --> 22:59.773
Studies.

23:00.212 --> 23:00.733
Stud...?

23:07.853 --> 23:08.492
Were you insane?

23:09.092 --> 23:10.132
Just say it.

23:11.052 --> 23:11.853
I really thought

23:11.853 --> 23:13.212
that you were endlessly charming.

23:13.613 --> 23:14.613
Come on, let me tell you.

23:15.013 --> 23:16.693
When a man and woman go out for a meal,

23:16.893 --> 23:19.332
there's usually
a hint of ambiguity and chemistry.

23:19.533 --> 23:21.132
And you two talked about studies?

23:22.693 --> 23:24.292
It seems Xu Zhi has no feelings for you.

23:28.212 --> 23:29.773
Yes, she does have no feelings for me.

23:30.893 --> 23:32.212
So don't bring up those topics

23:32.212 --> 23:33.172
in front of her anymore.

23:33.172 --> 23:33.720
Got it?

23:34.212 --> 23:35.613
Alright, fine.

23:35.933 --> 23:36.853
I was wrong, alright?

23:37.452 --> 23:38.212
I'll stop joking.

23:43.533 --> 23:44.693
Why did you change to black?

23:45.973 --> 23:47.212
None of your business.

23:53.132 --> 23:54.252
Dressed so stylishly?

23:54.733 --> 23:56.452
You're so trendy, Zhu.

23:56.533 --> 23:58.412
My name isn't being called for nothing.

23:59.013 --> 24:00.813
Zhu Yangqi, aka Stylish Zhu.

24:01.893 --> 24:03.332
What? Got a problem?

24:03.492 --> 24:04.653
No. As long as you like it.

24:05.332 --> 24:06.013
Here, take this.

24:07.452 --> 24:08.172
Get in the car.

24:15.252 --> 24:16.533
What? Are you going to drive?

24:17.092 --> 24:18.332
Does your car still have gas?

24:18.853 --> 24:20.573
Did you refuel it
last time you came back?

24:23.533 --> 24:24.088
It's enough.

24:25.372 --> 24:26.332
I'm going down tomorrow.

24:26.332 --> 24:27.172
I'll refuel it then.

24:28.573 --> 24:29.893
You're going down again tomorrow?

24:30.893 --> 24:31.492
What for?

24:32.653 --> 24:34.013
If you're uninterested, don't ask.

24:34.172 --> 24:35.172
Going down tomorrow?

24:35.853 --> 24:36.533
It's my mom.

24:43.132 --> 24:43.733
Not this time.

24:44.452 --> 24:45.773
I'll introduce you next time.

24:49.973 --> 24:50.693
Why the tantrum?

24:50.693 --> 24:51.212
Zhi, hurry.

24:59.172 --> 25:00.533
Fasten your seat belts.

25:00.533 --> 25:01.653
Let's go.

25:04.452 --> 25:05.573
Let's go.

25:25.452 --> 25:26.533
This place is so beautiful.

25:27.252 --> 25:28.212
Where to put the bottle?

25:28.372 --> 25:30.092
Can the grill be used if washed?

25:32.052 --> 25:33.573
Someone left it here. It's dirty.

25:43.172 --> 25:43.853
Are you okay?

25:44.492 --> 25:45.452
Yes.

25:47.172 --> 25:48.212
Don't break the camera.

25:48.933 --> 25:50.092
Is your camera expensive?

25:50.613 --> 25:52.132
It's sturdier than your flesh anyway.

26:00.172 --> 26:01.533
Alright.

26:02.212 --> 26:02.893
Isn't it enough?

26:04.573 --> 26:06.172
Your ears are turning red, bro.

26:07.292 --> 26:07.893
It's the cold.

26:08.492 --> 26:09.212
No, the cowardice.

26:17.613 --> 26:18.136
Here.

26:23.092 --> 26:23.608
May I?

26:23.773 --> 26:24.693
The two cups are empty.

26:29.092 --> 26:30.092
Lucy, stop adjusting it.

26:30.092 --> 26:31.052
The lighting is good.

26:31.052 --> 26:31.653
Come on.

26:31.653 --> 26:32.292
Take some shots.

26:33.132 --> 26:33.973
I'm done adjusting.

26:34.292 --> 26:35.212
I've posed already.

26:35.332 --> 26:36.132
It's fine. Come on.

26:37.813 --> 26:38.332
Okay.

26:41.172 --> 26:42.252
The lighting is average.

26:42.813 --> 26:43.893
But the model is handsome.

26:45.372 --> 26:47.132
The meteors are here!

26:47.132 --> 26:48.733
There are meteors.

26:48.933 --> 26:49.933
Look at the meteors.

26:50.296 --> 26:50.872
Quick, look.

26:50.872 --> 26:51.372
Where?

26:51.372 --> 26:52.332
There. Did you see?

26:52.973 --> 26:53.773
It's true.

26:56.172 --> 26:57.653
Meteors. Look.

26:59.252 --> 27:00.172
I want to make a wish.

27:00.613 --> 27:02.573
I want to go to the same city as Zhi.

27:04.372 --> 27:05.372
Heavens, bless me.

27:05.613 --> 27:07.252
I want to host an art exhibition
and go to

27:07.252 --> 27:08.092
the art academy.

27:08.332 --> 27:10.172
What heavens? It's meteors.

27:10.693 --> 27:11.252
It's the same.

27:12.212 --> 27:13.092
Zhi, make a wish.

27:14.973 --> 27:16.332
I want to make a lot of money.

27:19.212 --> 27:20.773
Lucy, what is your wish?

27:22.332 --> 27:23.292
I hope for

27:27.492 --> 27:28.492
world peace.

27:30.092 --> 27:31.092
What a grand vision.

27:31.212 --> 27:32.252
Go work in space then.

27:32.252 --> 27:33.013
Exactly.

27:33.853 --> 27:35.092
Another wave of meteors.

27:35.573 --> 27:37.372
Look, there are so many.

27:39.733 --> 27:40.613
Quick, take pictures.

27:42.013 --> 27:43.092
Don't use a filter.

27:43.092 --> 27:43.773
No filters.

27:43.773 --> 27:44.933
A filter makes it better.

27:51.613 --> 27:53.332
Xu Zhi, turn around and look at me.

27:57.042 --> 27:59.448
♪On a midsummer night♪

28:00.856 --> 28:03.992
♪The streetlights gradually awaken♪

28:07.096 --> 28:10.022
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

28:10.296 --> 28:15.411
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

28:17.051 --> 28:19.606
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

28:19.606 --> 28:21.712
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

28:22.362 --> 28:24.408
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

28:24.888 --> 28:26.276
♪The whole world pauses♪

28:27.224 --> 28:30.231
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

28:33.114 --> 28:34.520
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

28:34.520 --> 28:37.697
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

28:37.697 --> 28:39.859
♪Falling into your eyes♪

28:39.859 --> 28:42.200
♪Oh oh♪

28:42.546 --> 28:44.684
♪Billions of raindrops♪

28:44.888 --> 28:47.611
♪Like the universe's response♪

28:47.611 --> 28:50.072
♪Landing in my heart's depth♪

28:54.613 --> 28:55.733
It's hard to imagine

28:55.893 --> 28:57.332
that every single meteor just now

28:57.492 --> 28:59.332
completely disappeared in the universe.

28:59.733 --> 29:00.613
How wonderful.

29:00.933 --> 29:02.573
Not a second early or late.

29:02.733 --> 29:04.013
It's the four of us

29:04.013 --> 29:05.292
witnessing this moment together.

29:15.292 --> 29:17.212
Did you take
all these pictures just now?

29:19.132 --> 29:20.372
Your spot was good.

29:21.052 --> 29:22.573
Then can you send the photos to me?

29:22.573 --> 29:23.372
For Moments posts.

29:25.212 --> 29:26.613
Don't you rarely post on Moments?

29:26.853 --> 29:28.013
You saw my Moments?

29:30.332 --> 29:32.332
Just browsing, nothing else.

29:32.613 --> 29:33.252
I know.

29:33.573 --> 29:34.853
But I have groups.

29:35.212 --> 29:36.533
You can't see many things.

29:38.412 --> 29:40.172
How about I add you to the right group?

29:40.292 --> 29:41.292
Send me the photos.

29:41.336 --> 29:42.700
I'll list you as the photographer.

29:44.332 --> 29:45.252
Add me if you want.

29:45.452 --> 29:46.132
Why ask so much?

29:47.212 --> 29:48.292
Why are you so mean to her?

29:50.733 --> 29:51.492
Was I mean to you?

29:54.452 --> 29:56.013
You were a bit mean earlier.

29:57.773 --> 29:58.573
Sorry.

30:06.452 --> 30:06.973
Yingying,

30:07.212 --> 30:08.212
how about we go there

30:08.292 --> 30:09.452
to take photos by the spring?

30:10.292 --> 30:11.533
Are you a good photographer?

30:11.693 --> 30:13.172
Of course, I am.

30:13.452 --> 30:14.813
Then you guys have fun here.

30:14.893 --> 30:15.492
We're leaving.

30:15.492 --> 30:16.120
Have fun.

30:16.120 --> 30:16.664
Let's go.

30:16.664 --> 30:17.336
Let's go.

30:18.092 --> 30:18.613
Talk well.

30:45.853 --> 30:47.292
Come here. I'll show you something.

30:51.212 --> 30:51.813
What is it?

30:54.613 --> 30:55.412
There's another one?

30:56.613 --> 30:57.973
I thought the meteor shower ended.

30:58.172 --> 30:59.412
Why was there a straggler?

31:03.412 --> 31:04.372
But the one you shot

31:04.372 --> 31:06.332
feels better
than what I saw with the naked eye.

31:07.893 --> 31:09.172
Of course. Because I shot it.

31:13.252 --> 31:14.813
Do you like shooting the starry sky?

31:15.813 --> 31:16.492
It's all right.

31:16.813 --> 31:17.973
I like photographing people.

31:20.212 --> 31:22.013
I photograph people
of all ages and genders.

31:22.172 --> 31:22.936
Don't overthink it.

31:23.212 --> 31:23.933
I wasn't.

31:24.132 --> 31:25.132
I'm just a bit curious.

31:25.412 --> 31:26.893
Will you learn photography abroad?

31:28.533 --> 31:29.973
Why are you so curious?

31:30.412 --> 31:32.292
Because it seems like
you know a lot of things.

31:32.492 --> 31:34.212
But I don't know what you like exactly.

31:37.492 --> 31:39.292
Sometimes we don't necessarily get to do

31:39.372 --> 31:40.172
what we like.

31:42.372 --> 31:43.893
Do you like architecture?

31:48.653 --> 31:50.412
But my dad might not be that supportive.

31:51.252 --> 31:53.172
He thinks architecture
is too tiring for a girl,

31:53.573 --> 31:55.573
and it requires
a lot of construction site visits.

31:55.733 --> 31:57.372
My mom studied architecture.

31:57.773 --> 31:58.933
The underwater bookstore

31:59.013 --> 31:59.773
is her work.

32:00.533 --> 32:01.933
Your mom designed it?

32:02.533 --> 32:04.693
I want to become an architect like her.

32:05.172 --> 32:07.172
Watching my own designs

32:07.292 --> 32:09.052
turn from drawings into reality

32:09.573 --> 32:10.893
must be very fulfilling.

32:15.013 --> 32:16.212
If you like it, just do it.

32:17.132 --> 32:18.372
No need to worry so much.

32:22.013 --> 32:23.933
Actually, a long time ago,

32:24.052 --> 32:25.332
I had already given up the idea

32:25.733 --> 32:28.132
of studying out of town
because of my family.

32:30.013 --> 32:31.773
But what you said to me yesterday

32:32.092 --> 32:33.653
had a deep impact on me.

32:35.452 --> 32:36.412
I've been wondering

32:37.212 --> 32:38.492
whether I can

32:38.613 --> 32:40.052
go to a better school.

32:40.933 --> 32:41.933
It was just a suggestion.

32:42.653 --> 32:43.733
The choice is yours.

32:44.452 --> 32:46.452
Like today. You were waiting
for the starry sky,

32:47.212 --> 32:49.412
while I was waiting
for the autumn breeze.

32:50.533 --> 32:53.332
There are also people waiting
for flowers to bloom in the desert.

32:54.853 --> 32:57.092
Everyone has their own choices
and their own scenery.

33:01.372 --> 33:02.693
Must it always be scenery?

33:04.573 --> 33:05.332
Why the question?

33:06.933 --> 33:08.252
Our future is the scenery.

33:12.052 --> 33:13.052
No one else has a say.

33:14.052 --> 33:15.013
We decide for ourselves.

33:28.853 --> 33:30.733
If I'm going to study in Beijing,

33:31.252 --> 33:32.773
I need to earn more living expenses.

33:34.212 --> 33:35.092
You're resourceful.

33:35.613 --> 33:36.653
Do you have any ideas?

33:38.092 --> 33:39.332
You can't join my project.

33:39.693 --> 33:40.653
What project?

33:41.172 --> 33:41.813
Chat companion.

33:47.013 --> 33:48.973
Can I pay five yuan
to check it out first?

33:49.893 --> 33:50.613
Dream on.

33:51.973 --> 33:52.813
Then I'll pass.

33:53.252 --> 33:54.533
Your project isn't serious.

33:55.372 --> 33:57.212
Do you want to join me
on something else?

33:58.372 --> 33:58.933
Like what?

33:59.252 --> 33:59.853
Like buying

34:00.693 --> 34:01.653
some tropical fish

34:01.813 --> 34:02.933
to resell by the street.

34:04.533 --> 34:05.613
So, you've had a plan.

34:05.613 --> 34:06.893
And you want my funding.

34:07.212 --> 34:08.212
I have no choice.

34:08.533 --> 34:09.893
I don't have a rich little brother

34:10.212 --> 34:11.212
to get started.

34:12.092 --> 34:13.893
You'll need more than that.

34:15.533 --> 34:17.372
You'll need
a rich, silly little brother.

34:22.013 --> 34:22.773
Zhi,

34:23.412 --> 34:24.132
it's time to go.

34:25.092 --> 34:26.252
Where did you two just go?

34:26.492 --> 34:27.212
It's a secret.

34:29.733 --> 34:31.412
Let's put the food in the car first.

34:41.693 --> 34:42.853
Isn't it dirty?

34:43.252 --> 34:44.653
Don't grab anything in your hands.

34:45.613 --> 34:47.052
I used to chew it when I was a kid.

34:47.292 --> 34:48.252
Is it an honor?

34:49.092 --> 34:50.533
Get some more for breakfast then.

34:50.773 --> 34:51.533
Maybe I will.

34:52.024 --> 34:53.080
Only if you don't mind.

34:53.452 --> 34:55.052
I just saw Zhu Yangqi pee here.

34:56.212 --> 34:57.613
That's gross.

35:19.416 --> 35:20.013
Zhi,

35:20.212 --> 35:21.653
did Lucy upset you again?

35:24.853 --> 35:25.933
I'm impressed, Chen Luzhou.

35:25.933 --> 35:27.492
You actually made Zhi angry.

35:27.693 --> 35:29.653
I haven't seen Zhi angry
in all these years.

35:29.653 --> 35:30.372
Right, Zhi?

35:30.372 --> 35:31.332
Not my fault.

35:32.212 --> 35:32.893
You may ask her.

35:33.853 --> 35:36.172
Slow down. I'm really going to throw up.

35:36.252 --> 35:36.760
Okay.

35:37.613 --> 35:39.372
Let's have Zhu Yangqi
get out of the car.

35:39.533 --> 35:40.212
Okay.

35:40.212 --> 35:41.172
Wait, what?

35:41.813 --> 35:44.212
What does your argument
have to do with me?

35:50.733 --> 35:52.573
Of course,
it has something to do with you.

35:53.412 --> 35:55.412
People have needs.

35:55.733 --> 35:56.893
Could you hold it in?

35:57.973 --> 35:59.252
I knew we'd be in the mountain.

35:59.252 --> 36:00.212
So I didn't drink water.

36:00.613 --> 36:01.693
The girls were there too.

36:02.092 --> 36:03.252
You should be more careful.

36:04.092 --> 36:05.492
Okay, you got me.

36:06.853 --> 36:08.733
Next time, when I go out with girls,

36:08.733 --> 36:09.533
I won't drink water.

36:10.172 --> 36:10.813
Alright?

36:11.352 --> 36:12.024
Alright.

36:14.492 --> 36:15.412
You can drink now.

36:16.372 --> 36:17.052
Thank you.

36:19.608 --> 36:20.212
I can't drink.

36:20.733 --> 36:21.492
I don't want that.

36:26.773 --> 36:27.613
By the way,

36:28.693 --> 36:31.092
you tried so hard to coax Xu Zhi.

36:31.092 --> 36:31.896
Will you pursue her?

36:32.212 --> 36:33.412
Who told you that?

36:34.212 --> 36:35.492
Then why did you coax her?

36:36.052 --> 36:37.292
I coax you too when you're mad.

36:38.733 --> 36:39.853
I always coax you.

36:39.853 --> 36:40.933
Alright, bro?

36:43.893 --> 36:44.693
But seriously.

36:45.653 --> 36:46.412
Are you sure?

36:46.853 --> 36:48.132
You will make a great couple.

36:50.853 --> 36:51.372
Really?

36:56.052 --> 36:56.573
Alright.

36:57.653 --> 36:58.853
When I return from abroad,

36:59.013 --> 37:00.412
I'll pursue her if she's unmarried.

37:01.132 --> 37:02.252
What if she gets divorced?

37:02.773 --> 37:04.172
Can't you wish well for her?

37:07.052 --> 37:07.973
If she gets divorced,

37:08.653 --> 37:09.412
I can pursue her.

37:10.052 --> 37:12.372
Are you overthinking it a bit?

37:13.052 --> 37:13.933
I remember she said

37:14.132 --> 37:15.733
she doesn't have feelings for you.

37:18.252 --> 37:19.492
Why are you asking so much?

37:21.013 --> 37:21.560
I'll stop.

37:22.013 --> 37:22.813
I won't ask anymore.

37:41.813 --> 37:42.573
Chen Luzhou.

37:52.452 --> 37:53.492
Why do you want to drink?

37:53.693 --> 37:54.744
You said you didn't drink.

37:56.613 --> 37:57.933
Can't I get drunk late at night?

37:58.372 --> 37:59.252
Get drunk?

37:59.693 --> 38:00.653
With a cocktail?

38:01.092 --> 38:02.172
You're really bad at this.

38:04.252 --> 38:05.452
Were you really mad?

38:06.292 --> 38:09.013
To be precise, I was disgusted.

38:10.492 --> 38:11.132
I'm sorry.

38:11.693 --> 38:12.933
The joke went a bit too far.

38:13.132 --> 38:13.733
Joke?

38:14.292 --> 38:15.973
Where Zhu Yangqi peed was quite far.

38:17.052 --> 38:18.492
You can chew the grass if you want.

38:22.052 --> 38:22.693
Chen Luzhou,

38:23.813 --> 38:24.813
you are so childish.

38:25.212 --> 38:25.893
I'm childish?

38:28.973 --> 38:30.052
Didn't you trick me too?

38:31.412 --> 38:32.212
We're even now.

38:33.172 --> 38:33.688
Alright.

38:34.172 --> 38:34.933
Then we are even.

38:35.052 --> 38:36.056
We don't owe each other.

38:39.052 --> 38:39.653
Alright.

38:44.292 --> 38:44.813
Hungry?

38:45.492 --> 38:46.008
A little.

38:46.212 --> 38:47.613
What would you like? I'll order it.

38:49.613 --> 38:50.332
Then let's

38:51.573 --> 38:53.332
offer Master Kang some hot water.

38:55.092 --> 38:55.813
What is that?

39:01.292 --> 39:02.212
You're so mischievous.

39:04.132 --> 39:05.092
Excuse me.

39:05.613 --> 39:06.773
A bowl of instant noodles.

39:09.853 --> 39:10.893
Wait, sir, madam.

39:11.492 --> 39:13.132
An umbrella for you
to avoid getting wet.

39:14.104 --> 39:14.773
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

39:14.773 --> 39:15.288
Pleasure.

39:18.412 --> 39:20.613
How much was the food just now?

39:20.933 --> 39:21.533
I'll pay.

39:23.013 --> 39:24.013
Then pay

39:24.372 --> 39:25.412
for the chatting too.

39:25.613 --> 39:26.773
Let's chat ten more minutes.

39:26.893 --> 39:27.973
I'll be the companion now.

39:29.813 --> 39:30.653
Forcing a deal, huh?

39:30.893 --> 39:31.448
Yes.

39:31.773 --> 39:33.452
You've been forced to place an order.

39:34.212 --> 39:35.813
I find you really strange.

39:36.292 --> 39:37.813
Must you set all the boundaries?

39:38.653 --> 39:39.412
Last time as well.

39:39.412 --> 39:40.733
You pretended to have a boyfriend

39:40.733 --> 39:41.893
to treat me to that meal.

39:42.653 --> 39:43.693
You don't want to owe me.

39:43.853 --> 39:44.376
Is that it?

39:47.132 --> 39:48.573
You'll do it to your boyfriend too?

39:49.092 --> 39:49.973
Of course.

39:50.733 --> 39:52.013
But you're not my boyfriend.

39:52.252 --> 39:53.773
Does that have anything to do with it?

39:55.813 --> 39:56.332
Alright.

39:57.613 --> 39:59.212
Then let's split. Pay me on WeChat.

40:03.933 --> 40:05.172
Done.

40:08.212 --> 40:09.813
Good luck with your interview tomorrow.

40:10.533 --> 40:11.372
You can do it.

40:43.929 --> 40:46.424
(Our future is the scenery.)

40:46.892 --> 40:49.624
(No one else has a say.)

40:50.541 --> 40:54.374
(We decide for ourselves.)

40:57.024 --> 41:02.840
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

41:03.392 --> 41:08.920
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

41:10.432 --> 41:14.880
♪The world is too quiet♪

41:15.872 --> 41:22.800
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

41:23.712 --> 41:28.800
♪Who will visit me♪

41:29.856 --> 41:35.480
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

41:36.224 --> 41:39.280
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

41:39.520 --> 41:44.840
♪Into concern and care♪

41:50.368 --> 41:55.480
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

41:56.000 --> 42:01.840
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

42:03.296 --> 42:06.680
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

42:06.816 --> 42:13.040
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

42:13.536 --> 42:16.480
♪The lonely clock♪

42:16.640 --> 42:21.240
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

42:21.632 --> 42:24.880
♪Are we both♪

42:25.152 --> 42:28.680
♪Attracted to each other♪

42:29.824 --> 42:36.440
♪Falling into you♪

42:40.160 --> 42:45.960
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

42:46.816 --> 42:49.480
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

42:50.016 --> 42:54.640
♪From reaching eternity♪

42:55.040 --> 42:58.320
♪After rushing recklessly♪

42:58.528 --> 43:01.960
♪We approach each other♪

43:03.232 --> 43:06.840
♪Without turning back♪

43:08.224 --> 43:15.880
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

43:16.512 --> 43:23.000
♪Falling into you♪
